nk\" id=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/\">Guangdong Shampoo Factory<\/a><\/strong> is a private owned manufacturer. We specialize in professional shampoo production. Our team has over 16 years of experience. We operate 20 modern production lines. Our facility uses advanced technology for quality and efficiency.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-our-scale-of-partnership\">Our Scale of Partnership<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We have supported more than 3,000 brands globally. Our clients range from startups to major labels. Our products reach consumers across six continents.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">See our key market specialties below:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Market Region<\/th><th>Key Service Focus<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Europe &amp; USA<\/td><td>Organic formulas, sustainable solutions<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Southeast Asia<\/td><td>Nourishing blends, rich fragrances<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Middle East<\/td><td>Deep-cleaning &amp; hydrating technologies<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Australia<\/td><td>Natural ingredients, rigorous standards<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-our-core-strengths\">Our Core Strengths<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Technical innovation is our foundation. Sixteen years of work builds great expertise. We maintain a strict quality control system. Every batch passes multiple checks. Our R&amp;D team explores new ingredients and trends. This ensures our products stay competitive and fresh.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/caviar-nourishing-conditioner-2.webp\" alt=\"Privately Owned Shampoo Companies\" class=\"wp-image-3233\" style=\"width:600px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/caviar-nourishing-conditioner-2.webp 800w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/caviar-nourishing-conditioner-2-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/caviar-nourishing-conditioner-2-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/caviar-nourishing-conditioner-2-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-value-for-our-partners\">Value for Our Partners<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We offer complete end-to-end service. We guide partners from concept to final product. Our lines handle both small and large orders. We provide reliable and flexible production capacity. This adaptability helps brands grow and succeed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Private manufacturers are vital supply chain partners. We help turn creative ideas into real products. <strong>Guangdong Shampoo Factory<\/strong> welcomes new collaborations. Let us create the next successful haircare product together.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Guangdong Shampoo Factory is a leading private-label shampoo manufacturer. With 20 production lines and 16+ years of expertise, we have served 3,000+ brands, supplying markets across Europe, North America, Southeast Asia, the Middle East, and Australia.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3235,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[109,113,112,80,110,78,111,86],"class_list":["post-3671","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized","tag-cosmetic-oem","tag-custom-shampoo-formula","tag-global-shampoo-supplier","tag-guangdong-shampoo-factory","tag-haircare-production","tag-private-label-shampoo-manufacturer","tag-privately-owned-shamp